  "verdict": "Both alternative shapes ~tie the points objective \u2014 the board's value ranking is already close to the money-maximizing shape; the objective is not where the edge is. CEILING trails points by $-100.0 total across 3 seasons (weekly-high \u0394$-100.0, playoff \u0394$0; mixed by season). FLOOR trails points by $-200.0 total across 3 seasons (weekly-high \u0394$-200.0, playoff \u0394$0; mixed by season). Thin (n=seasons); directional, not significant.",
  "proxy_verdict": "NULL even on the finer proxy: no shape beats the points objective with a sign-consistent, shape-specific edge on weekly-high win probability, consistency, or playoff-window points. Positive sums exist but are mixed by season and/or shared by BOTH tilts (generic, not the hypothesized effect). The board's value ranking IS the money-maximizing shape at this seat. CEILING exp_weekly_high_wins: \u0394-0.1327 wins vs points (higher better) -> hurt [3 seasons, mixed by season] ;; FLOOR mean_weekly_rank: \u03940.467 vs points (lower better) -> hurt [3 seasons, mixed by season] ;; FLOOR playoff_window_points: \u039427.52 pts vs points (higher better) -> HELPED [3 seasons, mixed by season] ;; CEILING mean_weekly_rank: \u0394-0.133 vs points (lower better) -> HELPED [3 seasons, mixed by season] ;; FLOOR exp_weekly_high_wins: \u0394-0.3719 wins vs points (higher better) -> hurt [3 seasons, same sign every season] ;; CEILING playoff_window_points: \u039429.5 pts vs points (higher better) -> HELPED [3 seasons, mixed by season] Thin (n=seasons); directional.",
  "note": "leak-free: projection is walk-forward, boom/bust + availability from PRIOR-season weekly only. beta pre-registered at 0.15 (board's opportunity nudge). Both alt objectives graded on the SAME optimal-lineup ceiling and the SAME fixed room as POINTS, so the delta isolates the objective. Thin (n=seasons) \u2014 per-season sign + component split is the read, not the CI."
